## PROOF 1, corrected -- what actually changed
  11 of 12 files: whitespace-identical after stripping whitespace (pure reflow)
   1 of 12 files: src/pressure_velocity/SIMPLE.cpp differs by ONE reordered #include --
                  "cfd/core/Logger.hpp" moved ahead of "cfd/discretization/Gradient.hpp"
